EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I was taking a little walk the other
day,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} and I stopped to pick up a Bell{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
I found on the ground.
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}While I was down there, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}I noticed
something!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} It had some gum stuck
to it, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}so I thought it might be yours.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Geçen gün biraz yürüyüşe çıkmıştım,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
